=== fc-e1: = on a FLOAT CTE output is refused ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: = and != between a FLOAT, DATETIME or TIMESTAMP output of a CTE and a constant that the type cannot hold (a value between two FLOAT values, or more fractional digits than the column has) are not supported.

=== tc-e1: = in a CASE condition is refused ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: = and != in a CASE condition between a DATETIME or TIMESTAMP column and a constant with more fractional digits than the column has are not supported.

=== tc-e2: = on a DATETIME CTE output is refused ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: = and != between a FLOAT, DATETIME or TIMESTAMP output of a CTE and a constant that the type cannot hold (a value between two FLOAT values, or more fractional digits than the column has) are not supported.
